SOAPBOX: Best effort but was hindered by antenna issues that manifested by the DB-36 shifting resonance on its own. I spent time troubleshooting down to the controller and having to replace the transceiver interface daughter board. I ran low power just in case the issue wasn't resolved. And then there were N1MM setup issues that I dealt with. This caused a late start - not getting on until Saturday night at 7:00PM. Running 50 watts on RTTY was challenging. Most of the time I was able to work a station but not all. A few that I missed I was able to pick up on Sunday.
